/**
 * @defgroup dynamic_buffer_stream_cr_api dynamic_buffer_stream CR API
 * @ingroup dynamic_buffer_stream_api
 *
 * @brief Composition Root (CR) API for the `dynamic_buffer_stream` adapter.
 *
 * @details
 * Exposes the CR-facing types and services used to configure and construct
 * `dynamic_buffer_stream` backends from their external borrowed dependencies,
 * complete their initialization with owned resources, and register the
 * adapter with a `stream` factory.
 *
 * @note This API is part of the CR surface. Runtime modules should not
 *       include it directly.
 */
